# pstack models

Use this map when a brief requests `/architect` or another pstack role. It does not require architect on ordinary work. If a named writer is unavailable, use the closest listed writer default and say so.

For all reviewer roles below, use the newest allowed and available GPT Sol at high, then native Grok at high, then Grok through Cursor at high. A GPT lead tries native Grok, Cursor Grok, then Sol. Never use Astra or Claude, including Cursor-hosted Claude, for review. If none is available at high within Settings, report a blocker and do not widen the allowlist. Name the fallback. GPT and Grok review code better, and Claude Opus writes the nicest code. Send a full rewrite requested by review to the newest allowed Opus as writer, keeping review on Sol or Grok.

